  m_Name: OarFishNaga
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  creatureName: OarFishNaga
  description: 'The oarfish naga can cause tsunamis- that, or it can predict them.
    No one is quite sure which is which. The hatchling [name pending]s are more docile
    than their parents, but just as elusive. The species itself is hard to study
    due to nearly unreachable habitats, so little of their behavior is known. Hatching
    one of these is a sign that someone has cared for the egg very well. It is theorized
    that most tsunamis caused by the [name pending] were caused by juveniles who
    are still learning the difference between creating and detecting the forces that
    make a tsunami.

'
